48.jpg?v=1791352091","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/4cd00eacc20a11f182490652962539d5/w1600/35-03424f7ae52cfa326d8807a28548bbd1.jpg?v=1791352091","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/4cd00eacc20a11f182490652962539d5/w1600/36-5481dce773b43582c3bf79f9c6226866.jpg?v=1791352091","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/4cd00eacc20a11f182490652962539d5/w1600/37-7c8938eb4835f4a40f347690354a83a0.jpg?v=1791352091","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/4cd00eacc20a11f182490652962539d5/w1600/38-eaf7d50c8a94485f6f7bbe0f9cb05753.jpg?v=1791352091","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/4cd00eacc20a11f182490652962539d5/w1600/39-d6d0c795fba570369850bf7142d03556.jpg?v=1791352091","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/ud1c46n7d0/properties/4cd00eacc20a11f182490652962539d5/w1600/40-73c7fbc1d6997b08f7eaa7d72853815e.jpg?v=1791352091"],"descripcion":{"es":"Ubicada en una tranquila calle sin salida en la apacible Zona F de Sotogrande, esta impresionante villa acaba de ser terminada. Diseñada pensando en la vida moderna, la vivienda aprovecha su orientación sur, inundando el interior de luz natural y abriéndose a vistas de jardines exuberantes y al relajante telón de fondo de bosques autóctonos.\n\nSituada en una generosa parcela de 1.786 m², la villa se accede a través de un largo camino privado que garantiza total privacidad. En el interior, la distribución de 550 m² es espaciosa y está cuidadosamente planificada, ofreciendo cinco amplios dormitorios, múltiples zonas de estar y entretenimiento, y transiciones fluidas a los espacios exteriores. Dispone de 265 m² de terrazas abiertas, 64 m² de terrazas cubiertas y una impresionante terraza en la azotea, ideal para disfrutar de las puestas de sol y veladas al aire libre.\n\nLa vivienda está equipada con características de alta gama, incluyendo calefacción por suelo radiante, aire acondicionado completo y un avanzado sistema domótico para el control eficiente de la iluminación, el clima y la seguridad. En el exterior, la piscina infinita de agua salada de 14,5 m x 5 m, climatizada por energía solar para mayor eficiencia, se integra armoniosamente con los jardines paisajísticos, creando un espacio ideal para el relax y el entretenimiento.\n\nCombinando una arquitectura elegante, tecnología ‌sostenible ‌y ‌un ‌entorno ‌apacible, ‌esta propiedad ‌es una ‌oportunidad única para compradores que ‌buscan ‌un ‌estilo ‌de ‌vida refinado en uno ‌de ‌los ‌barrios ‌más ‌codiciados ‌de ‌Sotogrande.","en":"Tucked away on a quiet cul-de-sac in Sotogrande’s tranquil F Zone, this striking new villa has been recently completed. Designed with modern living in mind, the home embraces its south-facing position, flooding the interior with natural light and opening up to lush garden views and the calming backdrop of native woodlands.\n\nOccupying a generous 1,786 m² plot, the villa is accessed via a long private driveway that ensures complete privacy. Inside, the 550 m² layout is spacious and thoughtfully planned, offering five large bedrooms, multiple living and entertaining areas, and seamless transitions to outdoor spaces. There are 265 m² of open terraces, 64 m² of covered terraces, and a stunning rooftop terrace—perfect for sunset views and alfresco evenings.\n\nThe home is equipped with high-spec features, including underfloor heating, full air conditioning, and an advanced domotic system for effortless control of lighting, climate, and security. Outside, the 14.5 m x 5 m saltwater infinity pool—solar-heated for energy efficiency—sits in harmony with the landscaped gardens, creating an ideal space for relaxing and ‌entertaining.\n\nCombining ‌sleek ‌architecture, ‌sustainable ‌tech, ‌and a ‌peaceful setting, ‌this property is a rare ‌find ‌for ‌buyers ‌looking ‌for a refined lifestyle ‌in ‌one ‌of ‌Sotogrande’s ‌most ‌desirable ‌neighborhoods."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Sur","Excelente","Nueva Construcción","Privada","Aire Acondicionado","Suelo Radiante","Jardín","Piscina","Armarios Empotrados","Terraza Privada","WiFi","Trastero","Lavadero","Baño En-Suite","Doble acristalamiento","Domotica","Sótano","Fibra óptica","Parcialmente Equipada","Cocina Comedor","Privado","Portero Automático","Alarma","Privado","Electricidad","Agua Potable","Teléfono","Paneles Solares Térmicas","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South","Excellent","New Construction","Private","Air Conditioning","U/F Heating","Garden","Pool","Fitted Wardrobes","Private Terrace","WiFi","Storage Room","Utility Room","Ensuite Bathroom","Double Glazing","Domotics","Basement","Fiber Optic","Partially Fitted","Kitchen-Lounge","Private","Entry Phone","Alarm System","Private","Electricity","Drinkable Water","Telephone","Solar water heating","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available","gps":{},"energia":{"CO2Rated":"","CO2Value":"","EnergyRated":"","EnergyValue":"","Image":""},"gastos":{"comunidad":"0","ibi":"0","basura":"0"}}